      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正是！　诸位将士，请多关照了！\n嗯嗯～呣，真是令人热血沸腾啊！　这『拼刀斗剑抢地盘大战』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e13018261a876ccf1737e5cfda859cf1cec082514108e1e3168a31d20b51cb80",
