      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呀～！　小栗前辈，请一定要加油！\n这么强的阵容，绝对稳操胜券了～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c1dd2183ad0b4666190627de131a012c082d27301d8c477f7d43e6114c671f4",
