      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――今年的『春季粉丝大感谢祭』也即将举办。\n赛马娘们准备参加一项令人格外热血沸腾的“那个竞技”――",
      "source_fingerprint": "da56c01154f8bd0001ec285aec1d3e3861582d97cecf893e7f09a86af35d02de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
